---
// Home 4 Glowing Dark Monochrome Partner Marquee
---

<section class="py-12 bg-[#0A0B10] border-y border-white/5 overflow-hidden select-none">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 mb-8">
      Trusted by mission-critical engineering & revenue teams worldwide
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-8 sm:gap-16 opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">SR</span>
        <span>SwiftRetail</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">CL</span>
        <span>Crestline Homes</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">LH</span>
        <span>Lumina Health</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-amber-950 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">OM</span>
        <span>Omnia Global</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-purple-950 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">PS</span>
        <span>PeakScale</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-bold text-white text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-rose-400 transition-colors">
        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-950 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-mono">NV</span>
        <span>Nova Clinics</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
